## 📖 Overview

**Prasad Consultancy** is an end-to-end web platform designed to streamline tax compliance, financial advisory services, and client lead management for a premier consultancy firm based in Pimpri, Pune.

The platform bridges complex tax laws with user-friendly financial tools—enabling salaried professionals, freelancers, and businesses to estimate tax liabilities, calculate real-time GST breakdowns, and request professional consultations in seconds.

---

## 🌟 Key Features & Functional Modules

### 🧮 1. Real-Time Interactive GST Calculator
- Supports both **GST Exclusive** (adds tax to base price) and **GST Inclusive** (extracts tax from gross price) calculation models.
- Provides real-time breakdown of CGST (9%), SGST (9%), Total Tax Liability, and Net Amount.

### 📊 2. Income Tax Regime Estimator (Old vs. New)
- Interactive comparison engine evaluating gross annual income against eligible deductions (80C, 80D, HRA).
- Automatically calculates net tax payable under both regimes and generates visual savings badges to guide user decision-making.

### 📬 3. Validated Lead Capture & Inquiry System
- Built with custom backend regex validation for 10-digit Indian phone numbers and message sanitization.
- Features URL query-based topic pre-selection (e.g., `?topic=itr`) and seamless redirection to dedicated confirmation routes (`/thank-you/`).
- Direct integration with Django Admin for real-time lead tracking and review.

### 🔐 4. Enterprise Security & Performance Hardening
- **Vulnerability Defense:** Built-in safeguards against CSRF, XSS, Clickjacking (`X-Frame-Options: DENY`), and SQL Injection (Django ORM parameterization).
- **SSL / HTTPS Enforcement:** Production settings dynamically enforce HSTS headers (`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 31536000`) and secure session/CSRF cookies.
- **Static Asset Optimization:** WhiteNoise compression engine (`CompressedStaticFilesStorage`) for fast asset loading under Gunicorn WSGI.

### 🎨 5. Charcoal & Bronze Gold Design System
- Luxury corporate color palette (`#121826` Obsidian Charcoal base with `#D97706` Bronze Gold accents) managed via dynamic CSS variables.
- Responsive mobile menu drawer, accordion-based FAQ interactions, and sticky mobile call-to-action bars.

