| **WSGI Web Server** | ![Gunicorn](https://img.shields.io/badge/Gunicorn-499848?style=flat-square&logo=gunicorn&logoColor=white) | Gunicorn 25.3.0 production server process |
| **Static File Engine** | ![WhiteNoise](https://img.shields.io/badge/WhiteNoise-6.12.0-121826?style=flat-square) | WhiteNoise compressed static asset handler |
| **Frontend Stack** | ![HTML5](https://img.shields.io/badge/HTML5-E34F26?style=flat-square&logo=html5&logoColor=white) ![CSS3](https://img.shields.io/badge/CSS3-1572B6?style=flat-square&logo=css3&logoColor=white) ![JavaScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/JavaScript-F7DF1E?style=flat-square&logo=javascript&logoColor=black) | Semantic HTML5, CSS Variables, Vanilla JS (ES6) |
