| **Configuration** | `python-dotenv` | Isolated environment variable management |
| **Cloud Hosting** | ![Render](https://img.shields.io/badge/Render-46E3B7?style=flat-square&logo=render&logoColor=black) | Render Web Service with automated Git CI/CD |

