## 📁 Project Directory Layout

```text
tax_consultant_site/
├── core/                       # Primary application handling business logic
│   ├── admin.py                # Customized Django Admin panel & filters
│   ├── forms.py                # Regex form validation & sanitization rules
│   ├── models.py               # ContactSubmission lead data schema
│   ├── tests.py                # Automated unit tests for routes and forms
│   ├── urls.py                 # Application level routing
│   └── views.py                # View controllers & response handlers
├── static/                     # Global static assets
│   └── core/
│       ├── css/style.css       # Design system & responsive layout styles
│       └── js/main.js          # Tax calculators & UI interactive scripts
├── templates/                  # Modular Django HTML templates
│   ├── 404.html                # Custom 404 Page Not Found
│   ├── 500.html                # Custom 500 Internal Server Error
│   └── core/                   # base, index, about, calculator, contact, thank_you
├── tax_consultant_site/        # Project root configuration
│   ├── settings.py             # Security, app middleware, & environment setup
│   ├── urls.py                 # Root URL routing dispatcher
│   └── wsgi.py                 # WSGI entry point for Gunicorn
├── .env                        # Local environment secrets (Ignored by Git)
├── .gitignore                  # Exclusion rules for local files and database
├── manage.py                   # Django CLI utility
├── Procfile                    # Web service execution command for production
└── requirements.txt            # Minimal Linux build dependencies
